# S-RA-001 (№858, ADR-0204 §7) — the handled refusal degrades the
# refused call to Unit and the pattern continues; the refused DELETE
# never runs (first=1: the granted delete affected 1 row; degraded=Unit:
# the exhausted second call degrades, it does not kill the program).
STATUS: ok
OUT: first=1|degraded=Unit
